    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking about a place",
     "texto": [
      "**Πού είναι…;** means «where is…?». To answer, you can say **δεξιά** (to the right), **αριστερά** (to the left) and **ευθεία** (straight ahead).",
      "**Κοντά** means near and **μακριά** means far. With a place, use expressions such as **στο μουσείο** (in the museum) or **στην πλατεία** (in the square)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
